                            <comment id="16941793" author="mmuzaf" created="Tue, 1 Oct 2019 12:51:03 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It seems to me that the issue is related to these lines:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeHeader panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;RowStore.java:135&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; void addRows(Collection&amp;lt;? &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;extends&lt;/span&gt; CacheDataRow&amp;gt; rows,
        IoStatisticsHolder statHolder) &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;throws&lt;/span&gt; IgniteCheckedException {
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;assert&lt;/span&gt; ctx.database().checkpointLockIsHeldByThread(); &amp;lt;- HERE

        freeList.insertDataRows(rows, statHolder);
    }
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeHeader panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;GridDhtPartitionDemander.java:981&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;private&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;boolean&lt;/span&gt; preloadEntry(CacheDataRow row, AffinityTopologyVersion topVer) &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;throws&lt;/span&gt; IgniteCheckedException {
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;assert&lt;/span&gt; !grp.mvccEnabled();
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;assert&lt;/span&gt; ctx.database().checkpointLockIsHeldByThread();

        ...
    }
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="16942743" author="ignitetcbot" created="Wed, 2 Oct 2019 11:56:44 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Branch: &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;pull/6929/head&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; Base: &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;master&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; : No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=4653528&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16942757" author="xtern" created="Wed, 2 Oct 2019 12:16:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hello &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=mmuzaf&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;mmuzaf&quot;&gt;mmuzaf&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;After &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11584&quot; title=&quot;Implement batch insertion of new cache entries in FreeList to improve rebalancing&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-11584&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-11584&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; checkpoint read lock is only acquired for persisted cache groups when rebalancing and it seems correct because we shouldn&apos;t delay checkpoint when updating memory region that &lt;tt&gt;checkpointer&lt;/tt&gt; does not handle. But changing this behavior affects a lot of pieces of Ignite (including indexes) and after some investigation, I decided that it&apos;s safer and more clear to return previous behavior.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Could you look at this patch?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16943429" author="ignitetcbot" created="Thu, 3 Oct 2019 08:50:21 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Branch: &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;pull/6929/head&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; Base: &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;master&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; : No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=4654959&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16943581" author="mmuzaf" created="Thu, 3 Oct 2019 12:41:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=xtern&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;xtern&quot;&gt;xtern&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Merged to the master branch.&lt;br/&gt;
Thanks for your contribution!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
